                            <i class="fa fa-shield-halved"></i>
                        </span>

                        SAP MM / NetSuite 3-Way Matching Protocol

                    </div>

                    <p class="grn-match-description">
                        Automated reconciliation between
                        <strong>Purchase Order (PO)</strong>,
                        <strong>Goods Receipt (GRN)</strong>, and
                        <strong>Vendor Bill (IR)</strong>.
                        Tolerance threshold configured at
                        <strong>&plusmn;0.5%</strong>.
                    </p>

                    <span class="grn-verified">
                        <i class="fa fa-circle-check"></i>
